<urn:atm:triage:finding/ATM-QA-003>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "ATM-QA-003" ;
  triage:title "preflight_close (task_close.rs stage-1 abstraction) is dead code, never called from TaskCloseCommand::run" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr QA-1 (req-qa), PR #1408 @ 5ab184d75, https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1408#issuecomment-5642703785. preflight_close (crates/atm-core/src/task_close.rs:16-32, the named stage-1 abstraction from design section 5.2 / task 4) is dead code -- never called from TaskCloseCommand::run (crates/atm/src/commands/task.rs:266-289) or anywhere else in the tree. The close command reimplements the identical list-then-find logic inline instead. Recommend wiring TaskCloseCommand::run through preflight_close as designed, or deleting the unused function and updating the sprint doc. fenix's ruling: fix in R1 (BA4-FIX-R1, solar)." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ba" ;
